  description: "During the Battle Phase: Declare a whole number from 1 to 6; choose
    1 Effect Monster your opponent controls. Multiply the Effect Monster's Level
    x the declared number, then add the number of cards your opponent controls, and
    check if the result equals the number of cards in your GY.\r\n\u25CF If yes:
    Send cards from the top of your Deck to the GY, up to the declared number, and
    if you do, shuffle cards your opponent controls into the Deck, up to the number
    sent to the GY.\r\n\u25CF If no: You lose LP equal to the declared number x 500.\r\nYou
    can only activate 1 \"Linear Equation Cannon\" per turn."
